{"metadata":{"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"“∞-向量丛”"},2],"slug":[{"Plain":"∞-向量丛"},0],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<p>设 $K$ 为交换环 ("},{"Local":{"url":"E∞-环","text":"E∞-环"}},{"Plain":"), $A$ 为 $K$-代数.</p>\n<p>将空间等同于 (∞-) 群胚, 那么空间 $X$ 上的 $A$-模丛就是函子 $X \\to A\\mathrm {Mod}$.</p>\n"}]}}